From: =?UTF-8?q?Kamil=20Postro=C5=BCny?= <kamil@postrozny.pl>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:53:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: MESA_KK_DUMP_MSL_MIN_KB dumps pipeline libraries' MSL too

A Metal library built for a pipeline library shader translated by
MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=gpl did not reach kk_begin_metal_build, so
MESA_KK_DUMP_MSL_MIN_KB left it out. It is dumped now as a pipeline's
MSL is, with kind gpl, its stage's MSL and the SPIR-V the library was
made from. Libraries read back from a pipeline cache are not dumped
again.

A measurement for Portal 2's pipeline libraries, whose MSL is 5 to 20
times a whole pipeline's (vertex 245 KB against 11 KB, fragment 66 KB
against 12 KB) and whose Metal build time scales with it.

Without MESA_KK_DUMP_MSL_MIN_KB nothing changes.

Linear: PLA-437
Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-22-kk-gpl-cold-cache.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c
index d01c7a0..58b8946 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c
@@ -3922,6 +3922,15 @@ kk_gpl_build_library(struct kk_device *dev, struct kk_gpl_source *src,
       .step = vertex ? "vertex-library" : "fragment-library",
       .src = msl_src,
    };
+   /* MESA_KK_DUMP_MSL_MIN_KB: a library translated here is dumped as a
+    * pipeline's MSL is (kind gpl), with the SPIR-V the library was made
+    * from */
+   if (kk_dump_msl_min_kb >= 0 && front_end) {
+      char msl[BLAKE3_HEX_LEN];
+      kk_msl_hash(build.data, NULL, msl);
+      kk_dump_msl("gpl", msl, shader->info.stage, build.data,
+                  MESA_SHADER_NONE, NULL);
+   }
    kk_build_library(&build);
    if (KK_DEBUG(COMPILE)) {
       const char *how = build.library == NULL ? "FAIL"
